SELF_ADMIN-only — FULL POOL + MONOTONIC GLOBAL MATCHING (DP) — WITH BOOTSTRAPS
================================================================================

NEW CONCEPT MAP (WHAT TALKS TO WHAT)
------------------------------------

           (Manual nosepokes you marked on the VIDEO timeline)
                               manual_video_times
                                         |
                                         |  MV alignment (MedPC -> Video):
                                         |  search affine map  t_master = t_video = a_mv*t_medpc + b_mv
