Fiber photometry (time, signal, control) ---- peri-event robust Z + INCREASE peak detection
                                         |
                                         v
Top events (INCREASE) -> CSVs + Figures + VFR-safe video clips (peak-centered)

KEY DESIGN CHOICES
------------------
1) MASTER CLOCK = VIDEO (PTS timeline) AND FIBER (shared start)
   - We assume fiber and video start together, so their time origins are the same.
   - We never warp fiber time to MedPC. MedPC is corrected into the master time.

2) VIDEO-LIMITED MASTER DURATION
