4) PERI-EVENT (INCREASE-only)
   - Robust Z per trial: (trace - median(baseline)) / MAD(baseline)
   - INCREASE peak = max robust Z in [0, +5] sec window
   - Peak time in video = event_time + peak_offset  (NO rescaling)

5) BOOTSTRAP STABILITY
   - MV bootstrap: resample manual anchors within each window, re-fit (a_mv, b_mv) locally.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
